      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "The technical innovations of Full Contact continue to resonate in contemporary action filmmaking. The film's dynamic camera movements and innovative shooting techniques influenced directors like Gareth Evans (The Raid (2011)) and Chad Stahelski (<a href=\"/movie/245891\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"245891\">John Wick</a> (2014)). Modern action films like <a href=\"/movie/341013\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"341013\">Atomic Blonde</a> (2017) and <a href=\"/movie/615457\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"615457\">Nobody</a> (2021) carry forward the tradition of raw, impactful violence established by Lam's work."
      }
